# Butler Routes - Elwynn Forest rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 24 confirmed rares and the fixed world containers
# of Elwynn Forest. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or
# standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Named mobs that are
# core-route quest targets (Garrick, Goldtooth, Princess, Hogger, Morgan) are NOT
# here: the core guide covers their quests. See docs/elwynn-companions-inventory.md
# for the full inventory this guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/elwynn-forest-rares
title Elwynn Forest - Rares & Treasures
levels 1-10
zone Elwynn Forest
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords elwynn, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

